Package: bitnet-server
Architecture: amd64
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 curl,
 ca-certificates,
 adduser,
 systemd
Description: Local BitNet b1.58 2B4T LLM as a systemd-managed OpenAI-compatible API
 bitnet-server packages Microsoft's BitNet b1.58 2B4T model and its bitnet.cpp
 runtime as a systemd service. After installation it exposes an
 OpenAI-compatible chat completions endpoint at http://127.0.0.1:11435.
 .
 The package builds bitnet.cpp from a pinned upstream commit during package
 construction, and fetches the model weights from HuggingFace on first start.
 CPU-only; no GPU required.
